Attack the target with either your ranged or melee weapons for 120% weapon damage.  For the next 10 turns random targeting, such as from Blink Blade and Warden's Call, will focus on this target.

Attacks against this target gain [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] critical chance and critical strike power while you take [6%, 15%, 21%, 24%, 27% (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] less damage from all enemies whose rank is lower then that of your focus target.
